  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 694925d99107355428ee965f7b9638b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'THOUSAND CUTS (Lightning, the ''flash'' form)

    You vanish, lines of light cross the enemy you face, and you reappear behind it. A moment later all the cuts land at once.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot ( + , , , ). 45 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 842929870}
  text: {fileID: 912780358}
  back: {fileID: 737492548}
  shown: {fileID: 997987437}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
