  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'DRAGON OF EMBERS (Fire, the ''dragon'' form)

    A great head forms at your shoulder and lunges ahead, carrying what it meets, and bites at the end.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot ( + , , , ). 40 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1465764032}
  text: {fileID: 247937825}
  back: {fileID: 981411013}
  shown: {fileID: 1926726257}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
